{"seq":40,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/cn-05-coastal-date-formats/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:49:45.725Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6cd9bed5b38d0894f9e7f1523a970bc57d4249a34968ee53358ce11f672ad8c3","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#coastal-team","text":"Kwame, the official handover of Pellucid Harbor Logistics to you was November 3, 2025. Moss's Coastal digest from November 2, 2025 says ownership changes hands \"tomorrow\", and the recap note Bettina filed on December 8, 2025 gives the same official date. That note also says Bettina kept running the account day to day through November 21, 2025 for the terminal cutover, and you took over day to day on November 22, 2025. For the CRM, the official date is November 3, 2025.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000132"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1792159200.000133","thread_ts":"1792159200.000132"}}
